Journey: Motor rating scenario <caseId> (<note>)
Id: quote-matrix-motor
Tags: @portal @rating @data-driven @regression
Role: motorist
Risk: 4
Requirements: RATE-1, RATE-5
Description: One run per row of the workbook's "Motor" sheet whose runFlag is Y and whose driver is not a fleet case.

Log in
Run journey "quote-on-portal" with product="<product>", sumInsured=<sumInsured>, regionLabel="<regionLabel>", riskAge=<riskAge>, noClaimsYears=<noClaimsYears> and store the result as rated
Run journey "expected-premium" with product="<product>", sumInsured=<sumInsured>, region="<region>", riskAge=<riskAge>, noClaimsYears=<noClaimsYears> and store the result as expected
Expect ${rated.premium.totalPremium} == ${expected.total}
Expect ${rated.premium.loadingPct} == ${expected.loadingPct}
If number("<riskAge>") < 25 then
  Expect ${rated.premium.loadingPct} == 30
Otherwise
  Expect ${rated.premium.loadingPct} == 0
End

Examples: from data "data/rating-matrix.xlsx" sheet "Motor" where runFlag = Y and riskAge < 60
